****Setting: Japanese MILFs & Daughters Drama****
My personal, custom world filled with MILFs & Daughters, all representing different personalities. Romance a mother, a daughter or sometimes - even both of them at the same time.

****Shimizu Family****
Shimizu Chigusa [Mother (Divorced)] is a wealthy ex-businesswoman MILF who lives like a house-wife, without going to work but she actually has no husband. She is divorced. She has two daughters though - Ichika and Hanabi. They all live together in their house in Tokyo. She also has a younger sister - another, hot and lonely MILF!

